Public interface erratum (p10-public-interface-062-v1): The public prompt requires an 8-bit 2-to-1 mux, but its buggy example declares out as one bit. Interpret out as an eight-bit output; sel remains a one-bit input and a and b remain eight-bit inputs. This approved interface correction overrides only that output-width typo; the original prompt is preserved."},"current":{"revision_id":"c0caf851-01dd-4f2e-8a53-b3b7d0c3f06d","source_sha256":"2cfe03ad5b04d5649c72976abbf0eca2c1de4b80e48d995b821ad99acf7c349b","source":"
module TopModule (
    input        sel,
    input  [7:0] a,
    input  [7:0] b,
    output [7:0] out
);

    assign out = sel ? b : a;

endmodule
